contributors
============
pianod uses several libraries that provide its foundation.  See COPYING
for a full list.

Pianod was developed by Perette Barella <perette@deviousfish.com>, with help,
encouragement, improvements and fixes from Nick Brown, Jon Chelton, Michael
George, Ted Hess, Michael R. Hines, Gary Koch, Ansen F. Labardee, Peter Li,
Henry So, Martin Stumpf, and Evi Vanoost.  My thanks to them.

Inspiration for several features (filtering, biasing algorithms) were
inspired by mserv by James Ponder.  http://mserv.org

My thanks, also, to those who created and maintain the included and
non-included packages pianod depends on (curl, various TLS packages, libao,
libsdl, gstreamer, taglib, ffmpeg, gzstream, etc.), as well as those building
the compilers and debuggers, autoconf and automake, and other tools which make
this possible.

Although no longer used, PromyLOPh's libpiano was critical for many years,
and their [Pandora documentation](https://6xq.net/pandora-apidoc/) was
critical in writing my own integration.  Thank you for the starting points!

Lastly, thanks to the many sites that offer solutions to technical snags,
especially http://StackOverflow.com
